#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:2
msgid "Project and Menus"
msgstr "Projecte i menús"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:4
msgid ""
"Everything you make in MASAFI-SimTwin lives in a **project**: one file "
"that holds all the models of a piece of work. This page shows you the "
"window, how to make, open and close a project, how to add models to it, "
"how your work is saved, and what each menu holds."
msgstr ""
"Tot el que feu amb MASAFI-SimTwin viu dins d'un **projecte**: un sol "
"fitxer que conté tots els models d'una feina. Aquesta pàgina us mostra la"
" finestra; com es crea, s'obre i es tanca un projecte; com s'hi afegeixen"
" models; com es desa la feina, i què hi ha a cada menú."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:9
msgid ""
"The MASAFI-SimTwin window with a project open and a Petri net drawn in a "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"La finestra de MASAFI-SimTwin amb un projecte obert i una xarxa de Petri "
"dibuixada en una pestanya."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:12
msgid ""
"The window with the *Bottling Line* project open and its *Filling "
"Station* model in a tab."
msgstr ""
"La finestra amb el projecte *Línia d'embotellament* obert i el seu model "
"*Estació d'ompliment* en una pestanya."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:17
msgid "The window"
msgstr "La finestra"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:19
msgid "The window has four parts:"
msgstr "La finestra té quatre parts:"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:21
msgid "The top bar"
msgstr "La barra superior"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:22
msgid ""
"From left to right: the main menu button (:guilabel:`☰`), the name of the"
" open project, which opens a list of recent projects, and, on the right, "
"the simulation controls, search and settings."
msgstr ""
"D'esquerra a dreta: el botó del menú principal (:guilabel:`☰`); el nom "
"del projecte obert, que obre la llista de projectes recents, i, a la "
"dreta, els controls de la simulació, la cerca i la configuració."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:26
msgid "The tool stripes"
msgstr "Les franges d'eines"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:27
msgid ""
"The narrow columns of buttons on the left and right edges. Each button "
"opens a **pane**: :guilabel:`Project` and :guilabel:`Libraries` at the "
"top of the left stripe, :guilabel:`Python Console` and "
":guilabel:`Problems` at the bottom, and :guilabel:`Properties` on the "
"right."
msgstr ""
"Les columnes estretes de botons de les vores esquerra i dreta. Cada botó "
"obre una **subfinestra**: :guilabel:`Projecte` i :guilabel:`Biblioteques`"
" a dalt de la franja esquerra, :guilabel:`Consola de Python` i "
":guilabel:`Problemes` a baix, i :guilabel:`Propietats` a la dreta."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:32
msgid "The document area"
msgstr "L'àrea de documents"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:33
msgid "The middle of the window. Every model you open is a tab here."
msgstr "El centre de la finestra. Cada model que obriu hi és una pestanya."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:35
msgid "The status bar"
msgstr "La barra d'estat"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:36
msgid ""
"The line along the bottom. It says what has just happened, such as a "
"project opened or saved, and it names the model you are looking at."
msgstr ""
"La línia de baix de tot. Diu què acaba de passar, com ara que s'ha obert "
"o desat un projecte, i dona el nom del model que esteu mirant."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:39
msgid ""
"The simulation controls (run, stop, fast forward and reset) and search "
"are there to show where they will be; they do nothing yet."
msgstr ""
"Els controls de la simulació (executa, atura, avanç ràpid i reinicia) i "
"la cerca hi són per mostrar on aniran; encara no fan res."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:44
msgid "The panes"
msgstr "Les subfinestres"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:46
msgid ""
"Click a stripe button to open its pane, and click it again to close it. "
"Only one pane of each group is open at a time: opening "
":guilabel:`Libraries` closes :guilabel:`Project`, and the panes at the "
"bottom take the whole width of the window."
msgstr ""
"Feu clic en un botó d'una franja per obrir la seva subfinestra, i torneu-"
"hi a fer clic per tancar-la. De cada grup només n'hi ha una d'oberta "
"alhora: obrir :guilabel:`Biblioteques` tanca :guilabel:`Projecte`, i les "
"subfinestres de baix ocupen tota l'amplada de la finestra."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:51
#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:337
msgid ":guilabel:`Project`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Projecte`"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:52
msgid "What the open project holds. It opens by itself when you open a project."
msgstr "El que conté el projecte obert. S'obre tota sola quan obriu un projecte."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:54
msgid ":guilabel:`Libraries`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Biblioteques`"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:55
msgid ""
"The elements a model is drawn with, grouped by kind of model. Drag one "
"onto a model to add it."
msgstr ""
"Els elements amb què es dibuixa un model, agrupats per tipus de model. "
"Arrossegueu-ne un a sobre d'un model per afegir-l'hi."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:58
msgid ":guilabel:`Properties`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Propietats`"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:59
msgid ""
"The name, the tokens, the description and the appearance of what is "
"selected in the model you are looking at, ready to be changed. With "
"nothing selected it shows the model itself."
msgstr ""
"El nom, les marques, la descripció i l'aparença del que està seleccionat "
"al model que esteu mirant, a punt per canviar-los. Si no hi ha res "
"seleccionat, mostra el model mateix."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:63
msgid ":guilabel:`Python Console` and :guilabel:`Problems`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Consola de Python` i :guilabel:`Problemes`"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:64
msgid "Not built yet."
msgstr "Encara no estan fetes."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:68
msgid "The main menu"
msgstr "El menú principal"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:70
msgid ""
"The menu bar is folded into the :guilabel:`☰` button to leave more room "
"for the model. Click the button and the menus take its place; they fold "
"away again when you choose an entry or click anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"La barra de menús està plegada dins del botó :guilabel:`☰` per deixar més"
" espai al model. Feu clic al botó i els menús n'ocupen el lloc; es tornen"
" a plegar quan trieu una entrada o feu clic a qualsevol altre lloc."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:74
msgid "The top bar with the menu bar unfolded."
msgstr "La barra superior amb la barra de menús desplegada."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:77
msgid "The menus, unfolded."
msgstr "Els menús, desplegats."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:79
msgid ""
"While no project is open only :guilabel:`File` and :guilabel:`Help` are "
"there: the other menus act on a project and appear when you open one."
msgstr ""
"Mentre no hi ha cap projecte obert només hi ha :guilabel:`Fitxer` i "
":guilabel:`Ajuda`: els altres menús actuen sobre un projecte i apareixen "
"quan n'obriu un."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:82
msgid "The File menu with no project open."
msgstr "El menú Fitxer sense cap projecte obert."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:85
msgid "With no project open, the window offers to make one or open one."
msgstr "Sense cap projecte obert, la finestra ofereix crear-ne un o obrir-ne un."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:89
msgid "Projects"
msgstr "Projectes"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:91
msgid ""
"A project is **one file**, ending in ``.mfstz``. Everything in it travels"
" together: you can copy it, send it or keep it under version control as "
"one thing."
msgstr ""
"Un projecte és **un sol fitxer**, acabat en ``.mfstz``. Tot el que conté "
"viatja junt: el podeu copiar, enviar o posar sota control de versions com"
" una sola cosa."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:95
msgid ""
"A project knows its own name, which is written inside the file. Renaming "
"the file in your file manager does not rename the project: it still opens"
" under the name it was given."
msgstr ""
"Un projecte sap el seu nom, que està escrit dins del fitxer. Canviar el "
"nom del fitxer al gestor de fitxers no canvia el nom del projecte: s'obre"
" igualment amb el nom que se li va donar."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:101
msgid "Making a project"
msgstr "Crear un projecte"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:103
msgid "Choose :menuselection:`File --> New Project…` (:kbd:`Ctrl+N`)."
msgstr "Trieu :menuselection:`Fitxer --> Projecte nou…` (:kbd:`Ctrl+N`)."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:105
msgid "The New Project dialog."
msgstr "El diàleg Projecte nou."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:108
msgid "The New Project dialog. The file it will make is shown under the fields."
msgstr "El diàleg Projecte nou. El fitxer que crearà es mostra sota els camps."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:110
#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:200
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Nom`"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:111
msgid "What the project is called. The file is named after it."
msgstr "Com es diu el projecte. El fitxer en porta el nom."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:113
msgid ":guilabel:`Location`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ubicació`"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:114
msgid "The folder the file goes in. :guilabel:`Browse…` lets you pick one."
msgstr "La carpeta on va el fitxer. :guilabel:`Navega…` us en deixa triar una."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:116
msgid ""
"The full path of the file is shown under the two fields. :guilabel:`OK` "
"stays disabled until there is a name, the folder exists and no file of "
"that name is already there. The new project opens straight away."
msgstr ""
"El camí complet del fitxer es mostra sota els dos camps. "
":guilabel:`D'acord` està desactivat fins que hi ha un nom, la carpeta "
"existeix i no hi ha cap fitxer amb aquest nom. El projecte nou s'obre de "
"seguida."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:122
msgid "Opening a project"
msgstr "Obrir un projecte"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:124
msgid "There are three ways:"
msgstr "Hi ha tres maneres:"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:126
msgid ""
":menuselection:`File --> Open Project…` (:kbd:`Ctrl+O`) asks for a "
"``.mfstz`` file."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Fitxer --> Obre un projecte…` (:kbd:`Ctrl+O`) demana un "
"fitxer ``.mfstz``."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:128
msgid ""
":menuselection:`File --> Open Recent` lists the projects you opened last,"
" newest first."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Fitxer --> Obre un projecte recent` mostra els últims "
"projectes que heu obert, el més nou primer."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:130
msgid ""
"The project name on the top bar opens the same list, with :guilabel:`Open"
" Project…` at its head."
msgstr ""
"El nom del projecte a la barra superior obre la mateixa llista, amb "
":guilabel:`Obre un projecte…` al capdamunt."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:133
msgid "The recent projects list under the project name on the top bar."
msgstr ""
"La llista de projectes recents sota el nom del projecte a la barra "
"superior."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:136
msgid "The recent projects, under the project name on the top bar."
msgstr "Els projectes recents, sota el nom del projecte a la barra superior."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:138
msgid ""
"Recent projects are listed by name. Two projects with the same name show "
"their path as well, so you can tell them apart, and a project whose file "
"is no longer there is dropped from the list. :guilabel:`Clear Recent "
"Projects` empties the list; the projects themselves are not touched."
msgstr ""
"Els projectes recents es mostren pel nom. Dos projectes amb el mateix nom"
" mostren també el camí, perquè els pugueu distingir, i un projecte el "
"fitxer del qual ja no hi és desapareix de la llista. :guilabel:`Neteja "
"els projectes recents` buida la llista; els projectes no es toquen."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:143
msgid "Opening a project closes the one that was open, saving it first."
msgstr "Obrir un projecte tanca el que estava obert, després de desar-lo."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:145
msgid ""
"**A project can be open in one window only.** If it is already open, in "
"another window or by somebody else on a shared folder, you are told who "
"has it and it is not opened a second time: two windows writing to one "
"file would lose each other's work."
msgstr ""
"**Un projecte només pot estar obert en una finestra.** Si ja està obert, "
"en una altra finestra o per algú altre en una carpeta compartida, se us "
"diu qui el té i no s'obre per segona vegada: dues finestres escrivint en "
"un mateix fitxer perdrien la feina l'una de l'altra."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:152
msgid "The Project pane"
msgstr "La subfinestra Projecte"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:154
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Project` pane shows the project as a tree: its name, then "
":guilabel:`Models`, :guilabel:`Simulations` and :guilabel:`Statistics`. "
"Simulations and statistics will be filled in once models can be run."
msgstr ""
"La subfinestra :guilabel:`Projecte` mostra el projecte com un arbre: el "
"seu nom i, a sota, :guilabel:`Models`, :guilabel:`Simulacions` i "
":guilabel:`Estadístiques`. Les simulacions i les estadístiques s'ompliran"
" quan els models es puguin executar."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:158
msgid "Right-click a node to see what can be done to it."
msgstr "Feu clic amb el botó dret en un node per veure què s'hi pot fer."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:160
msgid "The context menu of the project in the Project pane."
msgstr "El menú contextual del projecte a la subfinestra Projecte."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:163
msgid "The project's context menu: the same entries as the Project menu."
msgstr ""
"El menú contextual del projecte: les mateixes entrades que el menú "
"Projecte."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:165
msgid "The context menu of the Models folder."
msgstr "El menú contextual de la carpeta Models."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:168
msgid ":guilabel:`Models` offers to add a model."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Models` ofereix afegir un model."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:170
msgid "The context menu of a model."
msgstr "El menú contextual d'un model."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:173
msgid "A model can be changed or deleted."
msgstr "Un model es pot canviar o suprimir."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:177
msgid "Closing a project"
msgstr "Tancar un projecte"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:179
msgid ""
":menuselection:`File --> Close Project` saves the project and closes it, "
"with all its tabs. Opening another project and quitting do the same."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Fitxer --> Tanca el projecte` desa el projecte i el "
"tanca, amb totes les seves pestanyes. Obrir un altre projecte i sortir "
"fan el mateix."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:184
msgid "Models"
msgstr "Models"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:186
msgid ""
"A project holds any number of models. Each one is drawn in a tab of its "
"own."
msgstr ""
"Un projecte conté tants models com calgui. Cadascun es dibuixa en una "
"pestanya pròpia."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:190
msgid "Adding a model"
msgstr "Afegir un model"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:192
msgid ""
"Choose :menuselection:`Project --> New Model…`, or right-click the "
"project or :guilabel:`Models` in the :guilabel:`Project` pane."
msgstr ""
"Trieu :menuselection:`Projecte --> Model nou…`, o feu clic amb el botó "
"dret al projecte o a :guilabel:`Models` a la subfinestra "
":guilabel:`Projecte`."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:195
#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:198
msgid "The New Model dialog."
msgstr "El diàleg Model nou."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:201
msgid "What the model is called. Two models of one project cannot share a name."
msgstr ""
"Com es diu el model. Dos models d'un mateix projecte no poden tenir el "
"mateix nom."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:203
msgid ":guilabel:`Type`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tipus`"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:204
msgid ""
"What kind of model it is. Only :guilabel:`Petri Net` can be made today; "
"the other kinds are listed to show what is coming, and choosing one tells"
" you it is not built yet."
msgstr ""
"Quin tipus de model és. Avui només es pot crear una :guilabel:`Xarxa de "
"Petri`; els altres tipus hi són per mostrar què vindrà, i si en trieu un "
"se us diu que encara no està fet."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:208
msgid ":guilabel:`Time unit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Unitat de temps`"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:209
msgid "The unit the model's times are written in."
msgstr "La unitat en què s'escriuen els temps del model."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:211
msgid ":guilabel:`Distance unit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Unitat de distància`"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:212
msgid ""
"The unit its distances are written in. Only 2D and 3D models have "
"distances, so it is disabled for a Petri net and for a process flow."
msgstr ""
"La unitat en què s'escriuen les distàncies. Només els models 2D i 3D "
"tenen distàncies, de manera que està desactivada per a una xarxa de Petri"
" i per a un flux de procés."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:215
msgid "The new model opens in a tab, ready to be drawn."
msgstr "El model nou s'obre en una pestanya, a punt per dibuixar-lo."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:219
msgid "Opening, changing and deleting a model"
msgstr "Obrir, canviar i suprimir un model"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:221
msgid ""
"Double-click a model in the :guilabel:`Project` pane to open it. A model "
"is open in one tab at most: double-clicking a model that is already open "
"brings its tab to the front."
msgstr ""
"Feu doble clic en un model a la subfinestra :guilabel:`Projecte` per "
"obrir-lo. Un model està obert com a molt en una pestanya: fer doble clic "
"en un model que ja està obert en porta la pestanya al davant."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:225
msgid ""
"Right-click a model and choose :guilabel:`Model Properties…` to rename it"
" or change its units. Its type was settled when it was made and cannot be"
" changed."
msgstr ""
"Feu clic amb el botó dret en un model i trieu :guilabel:`Propietats del "
"model…` per canviar-ne el nom o les unitats. El tipus es va decidir quan "
"es va crear i no es pot canviar."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:228
msgid "The Model Properties dialog."
msgstr "El diàleg Propietats del model."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:231
msgid "A model's properties: the type is shown but cannot be changed."
msgstr "Les propietats d'un model: el tipus es mostra però no es pot canviar."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:233
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delete Model` removes the model and everything drawn in it. It"
" asks first, because **a deleted model cannot be got back**: undo does "
"not reach it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Suprimeix el model` elimina el model i tot el que hi ha "
"dibuixat. Abans ho pregunta, perquè **un model suprimit no es pot "
"recuperar**: desfer no hi arriba."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:238
msgid "Saving your work"
msgstr "Desar la feina"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:240
msgid ""
":menuselection:`File --> Save` (:kbd:`Ctrl+S`) saves every open model. "
"MASAFI-SimTwin also saves on its own:"
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Fitxer --> Desa` (:kbd:`Ctrl+S`) desa tots els models "
"oberts. MASAFI-SimTwin també desa tot sol:"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:243
msgid "when you close a model's tab, close the project, open another or quit;"
msgstr ""
"quan tanqueu la pestanya d'un model, tanqueu el projecte, n'obriu un "
"altre o sortiu;"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:244
msgid ""
"every few minutes while you work. You choose how often in "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Saving`, from 1 to 30 minutes; the default "
"is 5, and 0 turns it off."
msgstr ""
"cada pocs minuts mentre treballeu. Trieu cada quant a "
":menuselection:`Configuració --> Desament`, d'1 a 30 minuts; per defecte "
"són 5, i 0 ho desactiva."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:248
msgid ""
"A model with changes that are not saved yet has an asterisk after its "
"name on its tab, and the window's title says so too. Undoing back to what"
" was saved takes the asterisk away."
msgstr ""
"Un model amb canvis encara no desats porta un asterisc després del nom a "
"la pestanya, i el títol de la finestra també ho indica. Desfer fins al "
"que estava desat treu l'asterisc."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:252
msgid "A tab whose name ends in an asterisk."
msgstr "Una pestanya amb el nom acabat en un asterisc."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:255
msgid "The asterisk: this model has changes that are not saved yet."
msgstr "L'asterisc: aquest model té canvis que encara no s'han desat."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:257
msgid ""
"A model that cannot be saved is named in a message, and the other models "
"are saved all the same. Today that is a Petri net with an inhibitor arc "
"in it: the file format cannot hold one yet. When such a model would be "
"closed, you are asked whether to close it without saving "
"(:guilabel:`Discard`) or keep it open (:guilabel:`Cancel`)."
msgstr ""
"Un model que no es pot desar s'anomena en un missatge, i els altres "
"models es desen igualment. Avui és el cas d'una xarxa de Petri amb un arc"
" inhibidor: el format del fitxer encara no en pot contenir cap. Quan un "
"model així s'hauria de tancar, se us pregunta si el voleu tancar sense "
"desar (:guilabel:`Descarta`) o mantenir-lo obert (:guilabel:`Cancel·la`)."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:265
msgid "If the application stops"
msgstr "Si l'aplicació s'atura"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:267
msgid ""
"Every change you make is written down beside the project the moment you "
"make it. If MASAFI-SimTwin stops before your work is saved, whether it "
"crashed or the computer went off, open the project again: the work is put"
" back in its tabs and the status bar names the models it was put back in."
msgstr ""
"Cada canvi que feu s'anota al costat del projecte en el moment de fer-lo."
" Si MASAFI-SimTwin s'atura abans que la feina estigui desada, tant si ha "
"fallat com si l'ordinador s'ha apagat, torneu a obrir el projecte: la "
"feina es recupera a les seves pestanyes i la barra d'estat diu en quins "
"models s'ha recuperat."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:272
msgid ""
"What is put back is **shown, not saved**: the tabs carry the asterisk, so"
" you can look at it before you keep it. Save to keep it."
msgstr ""
"El que es recupera **es mostra, però no es desa**: les pestanyes porten "
"l'asterisc, perquè ho pugueu mirar abans de quedar-vos-ho. Deseu per "
"quedar-vos-ho."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:277
msgid "Earlier versions"
msgstr "Versions anteriors"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:279
msgid ""
"Every save that changes the project first keeps the project as it was, as"
" a numbered copy in a folder beside it: for *Bottling Line.mfstz*, the "
"folder is *Bottling Line.mfstz.versions*. The highest number is the "
"newest, and it is the project as it was just before the last save."
msgstr ""
"Cada desament que canvia el projecte primer en guarda una còpia tal com "
"era, numerada, en una carpeta al costat: per a *Línia "
"d'embotellament.mfstz*, la carpeta és *Línia "
"d'embotellament.mfstz.versions*. El número més alt és la més nova, i és "
"el projecte tal com era just abans de l'últim desament."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:284
msgid ""
"Once a project has kept more than 50 versions, opening it asks whether to"
" delete the oldest and keep the last 10. If you say no, nothing is "
"deleted and you are asked again next time."
msgstr ""
"Quan un projecte ha guardat més de 50 versions, en obrir-lo se us "
"pregunta si voleu suprimir les més antigues i quedar-vos les 10 últimes. "
"Si dieu que no, no se suprimeix res i la pregunta torna la vegada "
"següent."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:288
msgid ""
"A version is a whole project file. To go back to one, copy it out of the "
"folder, give it a name of its own and open the copy. Do not open it "
"inside the folder."
msgstr ""
"Una versió és un fitxer de projecte sencer. Per tornar-hi, copieu-la fora"
" de la carpeta, doneu-li un nom propi i obriu la còpia. No l'obriu dins "
"de la carpeta."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:294
msgid "The files beside a project"
msgstr "Els fitxers al costat d'un projecte"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:296
msgid "Next to *Bottling Line.mfstz* you may see:"
msgstr "Al costat de *Línia d'embotellament.mfstz* hi podeu veure:"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:298
msgid "``Bottling Line.mfstz.lock``"
msgstr "``Línia d'embotellament.mfstz.lock``"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:299
msgid ""
"Says the project is open, and by whom. It goes when the project is "
"closed; one left by a crash is cleared the next time the project is "
"opened on the same computer."
msgstr ""
"Indica que el projecte està obert, i per qui. Desapareix quan es tanca el"
" projecte; el que deixa una fallada s'elimina la propera vegada que "
"s'obre el projecte al mateix ordinador."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:303
msgid "``Bottling Line.mfstz.journal``"
msgstr "``Línia d'embotellament.mfstz.journal``"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:304
msgid "The changes not saved yet: what is put back after a crash."
msgstr "Els canvis encara no desats: el que es recupera després d'una fallada."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:306
msgid "``Bottling Line.mfstz.versions``"
msgstr "``Línia d'embotellament.mfstz.versions``"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:307
msgid "The earlier versions."
msgstr "Les versions anteriors."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:309
msgid ""
"Leave them alone while the project is open. To move or rename a project, "
"close it first and move the ``.versions`` folder along with it: the "
"application cannot see a file being renamed, so the versions of a renamed"
" project stay behind under the old name."
msgstr ""
"No els toqueu mentre el projecte està obert. Per moure un projecte o "
"canviar-ne el nom, tanqueu-lo primer i moveu també la carpeta "
"``.versions``: l'aplicació no veu quan es canvia el nom d'un fitxer, de "
"manera que les versions d'un projecte reanomenat es queden enrere amb el "
"nom antic."

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:316
msgid "The menus"
msgstr "Els menús"

#: ../../source/using/manual/project_menus.rst:318
msgid ""
"Entries that are not built yet are shown greyed out, so you can see where"
" they will be."
msgstr ""
"Les entrades que encara no estan fetes es mostren en gris, perquè pugueu "
"veure on aniran."

